WEBVTT

00:01:07.777 --> 00:01:09.195
I'm back.

00:01:10.279 --> 00:01:13.950
I've come back,
so I can embark upon a journey.

00:01:31.300 --> 00:01:34.929
<i>Now set free</i>

00:01:35.137 --> 00:01:41.310
<i>Your hidden feelings</i>

00:01:41.519 --> 00:01:45.189
<i>So that you may sever</i>

00:01:45.398 --> 00:01:51.237
<i>Reality that returns to nothingness</i>

00:01:51.445 --> 00:01:53.781
<i>Even if fate is inevitable</i>

00:01:53.990 --> 00:01:56.409
<i>Nobody can predict what will happen</i>

00:01:56.617 --> 00:01:58.953
<i>Defy it with all you've got</i>

00:01:59.161 --> 00:02:03.833
<i>Grasp the future reflected in</i>

00:02:04.041 --> 00:02:06.377
<i>Your eyes with your own hands</i>

00:02:06.585 --> 00:02:09.046
<i>Shout out</i>

00:02:09.255 --> 00:02:11.674
<i>Your existence</i>

00:02:11.882 --> 00:02:16.762
<i>Cry out</i>

00:02:16.971 --> 00:02:19.181
<i>Shout out</i>

00:02:19.557 --> 00:02:21.934
<i>Shout out</i>

00:02:22.143 --> 00:02:24.520
<i>No matter what hardship</i>

00:02:24.729 --> 00:02:32.653
<i>Awaits us down the way</i>

00:02:32.862 --> 00:02:39.243
<i>Light my fire</i>

00:02:44.582 --> 00:02:47.001
"Tanaka"

00:02:59.513 --> 00:03:02.516
I'm off to the Tokyo Outlaw tomorrow.

00:03:02.725 --> 00:03:03.726
Outlaw...

00:03:03.934 --> 00:03:06.520
Margery-san said to go anyway.

00:03:06.729 --> 00:03:09.732
She said to see, with my own
eyes, what I'm aiming for.

00:03:09.940 --> 00:03:11.650
Oh, really...

00:03:11.859 --> 00:03:13.277
Jealous?

00:03:21.994 --> 00:03:23.621
"Sato Keisaku"

00:03:25.081 --> 00:03:27.625
We talked just yesterday.
What's he thinking?

00:03:27.833 --> 00:03:29.210
Pick up the phone, already!

00:03:30.669 --> 00:03:34.131
A Crimson Denizen is on its way there!

00:03:34.340 --> 00:03:35.925
That's not my problem anymore...

00:03:36.133 --> 00:03:38.135
Of course it is!

00:03:38.844 --> 00:03:42.681
You know someone should
look after the Crystal Altar, right?

00:03:42.890 --> 00:03:45.351
And don't use that note.

00:03:45.559 --> 00:03:47.812
They might notice you doing it.

00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:49.438
Wait--

00:03:51.190 --> 00:03:53.609
I'm counting on you, Tanaka.

00:03:57.613 --> 00:04:03.160
I guess this is what happens
when you get scared and run...

00:04:04.203 --> 00:04:06.705
Damn it all!

00:04:08.541 --> 00:04:10.376
When you get back,
you'll owe me for this,

00:04:10.584 --> 00:04:12.044
<i>Sate'.!</i>

00:04:27.768 --> 00:04:30.479
Come on, it's the
middle of the damned day.

00:04:30.688 --> 00:04:33.232
Isn't it a little early to drink this much?

00:04:33.441 --> 00:04:36.694
My little malfunctioning clock,
Margery Daw...

00:04:36.902 --> 00:04:38.904
No one's asking you.

00:04:39.989 --> 00:04:44.535
Don't be so lonely just because
they've been gone for a single night...

00:04:44.743 --> 00:04:46.745
Shut up, already!

00:04:54.920 --> 00:04:56.922
Hey, Margery...

00:04:57.131 --> 00:04:58.549
I know.

00:05:01.343 --> 00:05:03.429
It's a big one.

00:05:03.637 --> 00:05:04.847
Seems so...

00:05:05.055 --> 00:05:08.684
Why can't I ever get a break?

00:05:10.227 --> 00:05:12.396
B-Big Sister...

00:05:12.605 --> 00:05:13.856
<i>Erma'?</i>

00:05:16.442 --> 00:05:19.403
"To Embark Upon a Journey"

00:05:38.964 --> 00:05:40.633
Splendid, indeed.

00:05:40.841 --> 00:05:42.927
Clear improvement.

00:05:43.135 --> 00:05:45.804
It's not good enough.

00:05:56.649 --> 00:05:58.025
This presence...

00:05:58.234 --> 00:06:00.444
Yes. It's a Crimson Denizen.

00:06:00.653 --> 00:06:05.366
No... From the size, a Crimson Lord.

00:06:07.826 --> 00:06:11.247
I see... Keisaku contacted you.

00:06:11.455 --> 00:06:12.164
Yes.

00:06:12.373 --> 00:06:16.001
He crossed a Denizen's
path the minute he left.

00:06:16.210 --> 00:06:19.213
I don't know whether
to call it good luck or bad...

00:06:19.421 --> 00:06:20.631
It ain't luck.

00:06:20.839 --> 00:06:24.677
It's the late start he got,
after you stayed up all night drinking.

00:06:24.885 --> 00:06:26.387
SHence!

00:06:27.555 --> 00:06:30.432
Let's go see them.

00:06:30.641 --> 00:06:32.893
But before that...

00:06:34.520 --> 00:06:36.564
Oh, my...

00:06:36.772 --> 00:06:40.734
You're really getting used
to functioning in a team.

00:06:45.114 --> 00:06:46.532
What's that sound?

00:06:46.740 --> 00:06:48.325
My phone, indeed.

00:06:48.534 --> 00:06:51.620
Since when did
you start carrying a phone?

00:06:51.829 --> 00:06:55.291
These days,
everyone carries them, indeed.

00:06:55.499 --> 00:06:57.126
Always on-hand.

00:06:58.669 --> 00:07:00.379
It is I, indeed.

00:07:00.588 --> 00:07:02.214
You've felt it, right?

00:07:02.423 --> 00:07:03.799
Of course, indeed.

00:07:04.008 --> 00:07:05.009
And the brat?

00:07:05.217 --> 00:07:06.552
She's here.

00:07:06.760 --> 00:07:07.636
Very well.

00:07:07.845 --> 00:07:10.848
Then I'll go have a
look at what we're up against.

00:07:11.056 --> 00:07:13.559
Would you stay on standby until then?

00:07:13.767 --> 00:07:15.519
Understood, indeed.

00:07:15.728 --> 00:07:20.190
Before that, shouldn't we check the
Crystal Altar for any Unrestricted Methods?

00:07:20.399 --> 00:07:22.151
It's a tough choice...

00:07:22.359 --> 00:07:26.405
I want to see if we're facing someone
who might start suddenly blowing stuff up.

00:07:26.614 --> 00:07:28.532
I'll take care of it.

00:07:28.741 --> 00:07:30.743
You're getting involved again?

00:07:38.834 --> 00:07:40.461
Yes.

00:07:40.669 --> 00:07:44.214
The man's serious!
You can't turn him down!

00:07:44.423 --> 00:07:46.592
You monitor the Crystal Altar.

00:07:46.800 --> 00:07:48.427
Contact me via cell phone.

00:07:48.636 --> 00:07:50.054
Yes!

00:07:52.973 --> 00:07:54.642
It's as you heard, indeed.

00:07:54.850 --> 00:07:57.144
Stand by.

00:07:57.353 --> 00:08:00.773
What's wrong?

00:08:00.981 --> 00:08:02.232
Wilhelmina...

00:08:02.441 --> 00:08:03.651
What is it, indeed?

00:08:03.859 --> 00:08:06.570
Let me see that.

00:08:16.830 --> 00:08:19.583
I don't know this number.

00:08:21.043 --> 00:08:22.378
Yes?

00:08:22.586 --> 00:08:23.712
Shana-chan?

00:08:23.921 --> 00:08:25.089
Listen carefully.

00:08:25.297 --> 00:08:29.510
A new Denizen of the Crimson World
has arrived in Misaki City.

00:08:30.427 --> 00:08:32.513
I don't have any details yet.

00:08:32.721 --> 00:08:37.393
But there's a possibility that
Ball Masque is up to something.

00:08:37.601 --> 00:08:38.936
Ball Masque...

00:08:39.144 --> 00:08:43.232
I think we're going to
have to fight this Denizen.

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:45.693
What will you do?

00:08:46.610 --> 00:08:49.071
Eita Tanaka is heading
to the Crystal Altar.

00:08:49.279 --> 00:08:51.240
Would you meet him there?

00:08:51.448 --> 00:08:54.660
If not, you should go as far as possible.

00:08:54.868 --> 00:08:56.954
I'll go to the Crystal Altar.

00:08:57.621 --> 00:08:58.997
If I run away now,

00:08:59.206 --> 00:09:03.919
I'll feel that I'm being forced from
the place where I really need to be.

00:09:04.128 --> 00:09:06.463
No matter what, I don't want that!

00:09:06.672 --> 00:09:09.675
All right. I understand.

00:09:23.355 --> 00:09:25.190
Yoshida-san...

00:09:27.818 --> 00:09:28.652
Let's go.

00:09:28.861 --> 00:09:30.279
Right!

00:10:23.081 --> 00:10:24.917
I'm sorry.

00:10:27.503 --> 00:10:31.131
I wonder if they got that letter.

00:10:32.758 --> 00:10:36.887
Not that it matters now.

00:10:38.347 --> 00:10:42.142
I'm here now.

00:10:46.313 --> 00:10:47.523
Is that...

00:10:47.731 --> 00:10:49.233
Seriously?

00:10:49.441 --> 00:10:51.068
What the hell?

00:10:54.863 --> 00:10:56.573
H-Hello?

00:10:56.782 --> 00:10:57.491
Brat.

00:10:57.699 --> 00:11:00.577
Listen, I need you calm when you hear this.

00:11:00.786 --> 00:11:04.832
The presence you're feeling right now is...

00:11:07.751 --> 00:11:10.045
What has happened?

00:11:10.254 --> 00:11:12.256
Explanation requested.

00:11:33.235 --> 00:11:35.237
I remember this place well.

00:11:36.321 --> 00:11:39.575
Everything began here.

00:11:39.783 --> 00:11:41.410
That day...

00:11:41.618 --> 00:11:43.787
My vision was filled with a deep red,

00:11:43.996 --> 00:11:46.039
like the setting sun.

00:11:46.248 --> 00:11:49.376
That day I was trapped inside the Seal...

00:11:59.136 --> 00:12:01.763
Yummy! Yummy!

00:12:01.972 --> 00:12:03.640
What is this?

00:12:03.849 --> 00:12:05.601
What's going on?

00:12:05.809 --> 00:12:07.728
What is this?!

00:12:09.771 --> 00:12:12.399
Gotcha!

00:12:12.608 --> 00:12:14.526
Time to eat!

00:12:27.122 --> 00:12:28.540
Who's there?!

00:12:38.342 --> 00:12:39.760
And then...

00:12:40.802 --> 00:12:44.806
...I met a girl with eyes and
hair the color of a blazing flame.

00:12:46.391 --> 00:12:48.352
It sounds pretentious,

00:12:48.560 --> 00:12:51.021
but it was fate that brought us together.

00:12:51.229 --> 00:12:55.651
If nothing else, the Yuji Sakai
here now thinks of it that way.

00:12:57.653 --> 00:13:01.073
There's still time before I see it again.

00:13:09.456 --> 00:13:12.834
Are you certain about this, Shana?

00:13:17.130 --> 00:13:20.425
It's been a long time since I was here.

00:13:24.805 --> 00:13:28.809
This was the first place Yoshida-san
and I went on a date, wasn't it?

00:13:30.352 --> 00:13:32.896
What exhibit did we go to see?

00:13:33.105 --> 00:13:38.068
What happened after was
so insane, I really can't remember...

00:13:42.948 --> 00:13:45.450
Lamies, the Corpse Collector.

00:13:45.659 --> 00:13:49.329
No... Spiral Organ Leanan Sidhe.

00:13:53.792 --> 00:13:57.879
And the Chanter of Elegies,
Margery Daw,

00:13:58.088 --> 00:14:01.341
who came to this city in search of him.

00:14:02.592 --> 00:14:06.471
Back then, she was really scary.

00:14:11.518 --> 00:14:14.730
Come to think of it, Sato and Tanaka both

00:14:14.938 --> 00:14:18.358
were already involved, even then.

00:14:24.698 --> 00:14:31.163
And the first Crimson Denizen
I defeated with Shana...

00:14:31.371 --> 00:14:33.373
Friagne, the Hunter.

00:14:39.463 --> 00:14:44.760
I was able to stand up in the
end because I heard your voice.

00:14:44.968 --> 00:14:47.971
I'm glad I could be of help.

00:14:49.681 --> 00:14:53.101
Most of my power of existence
has been sucked outta me.

00:14:53.310 --> 00:14:56.897
I guess I'm about to
face my fate of vanishing.

00:14:57.105 --> 00:14:59.691
Goodbye, Shana.

00:15:01.568 --> 00:15:05.739
After that battle,
I first learned of the power...

00:15:07.032 --> 00:15:09.868
...inside this body, within its Treasure,

00:15:10.077 --> 00:15:12.245
the Midnight Lost Child.

00:15:17.417 --> 00:15:21.129
I walked down this street
during the Clear Autumn Festival.

00:15:25.342 --> 00:15:29.262
If... If maybe, back then...

00:15:35.477 --> 00:15:38.146
Sakai-kun... No way...

00:15:38.355 --> 00:15:40.941
Yoshida-san? What's wrong?

00:15:45.862 --> 00:15:46.988
You can't...

00:15:47.197 --> 00:15:48.615
No!

00:15:49.157 --> 00:15:50.575
No!

00:15:51.993 --> 00:15:56.039
Earlier, if she hadn't
seen what was really going on...

00:15:56.248 --> 00:16:00.293
But she was the one who wanted to see.

00:16:00.502 --> 00:16:03.088
And once she knew...

00:16:04.840 --> 00:16:07.968
I love you, Sakai-kun.

00:16:11.138 --> 00:16:16.101
She was still kind enough to
love this strange thing.

00:16:19.437 --> 00:16:21.273
Yoshida-san...

00:16:56.308 --> 00:16:57.642
No...

00:16:57.851 --> 00:17:01.980
She wasn't the only one who accepted me.

00:17:02.189 --> 00:17:05.317
Sato and Tanaka both did, and...

00:17:05.525 --> 00:17:09.237
I personally feel it's
time to tell you everything.

00:17:09.446 --> 00:17:11.364
That's why my father told me

00:17:11.573 --> 00:17:14.117
what he felt when
he gave me the name Yuji.

00:17:14.326 --> 00:17:16.828
That I had a brother who hadn't lived long.

00:17:17.037 --> 00:17:17.621
And then...

00:17:17.829 --> 00:17:20.123
Yeah, how do I say this...

00:17:21.082 --> 00:17:21.958
She's pregnant.

00:17:22.167 --> 00:17:26.421
O-Oh... Oh!

00:17:26.630 --> 00:17:29.007
Congratulations, Dad!

00:17:29.216 --> 00:17:31.760
Wait, is that what I should say
in a situation like this?

00:17:31.968 --> 00:17:33.178
Thanks.

00:17:33.386 --> 00:17:35.764
And congratulations...

00:17:35.972 --> 00:17:37.807
Big Brother Yuji.

00:17:38.558 --> 00:17:41.144
Me, a big brother...

00:17:50.362 --> 00:17:55.325
A new life will be born,
to replace the missing Yuji Sakai.

00:17:56.993 --> 00:18:00.997
A little brother or sister
who will stay with my mother.

00:18:05.752 --> 00:18:07.879
I'm sorry, Mother...

00:18:09.422 --> 00:18:12.259
That I couldn't be with you.

00:18:14.886 --> 00:18:19.266
But I've changed...

00:18:24.229 --> 00:18:27.816
Misaki! Fight! On! Fight! On! Fight! On!

00:18:28.024 --> 00:18:31.778
Misaki! Fight! On! Fight! On! Fight! On!

00:18:31.987 --> 00:18:35.156
Misaki! Fight! On! Fight! On! Fight! On!

00:18:35.365 --> 00:18:38.952
Misaki! Fight! On! Fight! On! Fight! On!

00:18:39.160 --> 00:18:41.162
Misaki! Fight! On...

00:18:43.498 --> 00:18:48.586
Misaki! Fight! On! Fight! On! Fight! On!

00:18:48.795 --> 00:18:52.841
That's right. I knew this would happen.

00:18:53.049 --> 00:18:55.051
I knew everything.

00:19:06.438 --> 00:19:09.858
And I vowed, no matter who
I was or what happened to me,

00:19:10.066 --> 00:19:12.068
I would do it.

00:19:21.286 --> 00:19:27.042
The fear I felt, back when I lived here,
discovering that I'm not human...

00:19:27.250 --> 00:19:32.505
Of living as something
that isn't human... It's gone.

00:19:32.714 --> 00:19:35.842
The path I follow is long and difficult.

00:19:36.051 --> 00:19:39.763
But I saw a future I could truly believe in.

00:20:05.747 --> 00:20:08.208
I think that now, I can stand in the place

00:20:08.416 --> 00:20:10.919
previously beyond my reach.

00:20:12.003 --> 00:20:15.715
What was once just a tiny
Torch has made it all this way.

00:20:23.098 --> 00:20:27.227
I'm here because of those feelings.

00:20:44.452 --> 00:20:48.748
She allowed me to realize...

00:20:50.375 --> 00:20:52.836
...that it was okay to love.

00:20:53.044 --> 00:20:55.505
I can't believe it took so long to understand

00:20:55.713 --> 00:20:57.715
something so obvious.

00:20:59.509 --> 00:21:04.848
<i>I must be dreaming tonight.</i>

00:21:05.056 --> 00:21:10.395
<i>We erase it from our memories</i>

00:21:10.603 --> 00:21:12.355
<i>You can't escape</i>

00:21:12.564 --> 00:21:17.986
<i>I only know this secret with you</i>

00:21:17.986 --> 00:21:18.945
It's been a long path.

00:21:19.154 --> 00:21:22.157
But I've made it here.

00:21:22.157 --> 00:21:26.953
<i>How can I protect you forever?</i>

00:21:26.953 --> 00:21:28.496
I'm here.

00:21:28.580 --> 00:21:32.459
<i>I'll be anything for you</i>

00:21:32.459 --> 00:21:32.959
Shana!

00:21:32.959 --> 00:21:34.627
<i>I can't live this life</i>

00:21:34.836 --> 00:21:42.177
<i>Without you by my side...</i>

00:21:42.385 --> 00:21:47.515
<i>"I'll believe..."</i>

00:21:58.026 --> 00:22:00.987
<i>If the luster that made you shine</i>

00:22:01.196 --> 00:22:04.574
<i>ls also inside of me,
(then I'm sure that we can go)</i>

00:22:04.782 --> 00:22:07.744
<i>I will go and prove everything</i>

00:22:07.952 --> 00:22:13.708
<i>It is the reason why I continue to exist</i>

00:22:13.917 --> 00:22:15.001
<i>Inside of Kaos I say</i>

00:22:15.210 --> 00:22:18.296
<i>Where can I get the
real love and fate, right now?</i>

00:22:18.505 --> 00:22:21.633
<i>How can I make you
know my heart is with you hey?</i>

00:22:21.841 --> 00:22:25.053
<i>All people, everyone, forget things,</i>

00:22:25.261 --> 00:22:28.431
<i>Even their aching scars</i>

00:22:28.640 --> 00:22:31.768
<i>Each time I see the passage of time,</i>

00:22:31.976 --> 00:22:35.146
<i>These emotions fade</i>

00:22:35.355 --> 00:22:39.067
<i>But I don't want to
overlook things any longer</i>

00:22:39.275 --> 00:22:41.986
<i>Back and forth, the screaming
in my heart won't stop (time over)</i>

00:22:42.195 --> 00:22:48.535
<i>The vanishing afterimage,
that is you in and of itself</i>

00:22:48.743 --> 00:22:50.245
<i>So now that you & I</i>

00:22:50.453 --> 00:22:51.496
<i>I can't live life</i>

00:22:51.704 --> 00:22:53.456
<i>Without you by my side...</i>

00:22:53.665 --> 00:22:57.085
<i>"I'll believe..." Even in the
fatality of solitude (Yeah, yeah)</i>

00:22:57.293 --> 00:23:00.421
<i>The fragments of the burning records</i>

00:23:00.630 --> 00:23:03.841
<i>Reflect tomorrow's brightness
(Can see your light)</i>

00:23:04.050 --> 00:23:06.886
<i>If the luster that made you shine</i>

00:23:07.095 --> 00:23:10.640
<i>ls also inside of me,
(then I'm sure that we can go)</i>

00:23:10.848 --> 00:23:13.768
<i>I will go and prove everything</i>

00:23:13.977 --> 00:23:22.735
<i>"I'll believe..." in a tomorrow
where we coexist, (Yeah, "I'll believe")</i>

00:23:26.030 --> 00:23:28.366
Shana and Yuji finally cross swords.

00:23:28.575 --> 00:23:30.410
Their feelings collide.

00:23:30.618 --> 00:23:34.330
What will the Chanter of Elegies,
Margery Daw, see then?

00:23:34.539 --> 00:23:36.708
Next time,
on Shakugan no Shana Final:

00:23:36.916 --> 00:23:39.794
"Reunions and Chance Meetings."
